  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Use tokens to represent drones. They have no effect as models. **Guardian Drone**: For ranged attacks made against the bearer’s unit, modify the [Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) by −1. **Gun Drone**: give the bearer a twin pulse carbine with **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)** and **[[TWIN-LINKED]](vsdata:weapon-ability/twin-linked)** (Range 20″, A 2, BS 5+, S 5, AP 0, D 1). **Marker Drone**: give the bearer’s unit **MARKERLIGHT** and allow it to act as an [Observer](vsdata:ability/tau-empire.for-the-greater-good) after it [Advances](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) that turn. **Missile Drone**: equip the bearer with a missile pod (Range 30″, A 2, BS 5+, S 7, AP −1, D 2). **Shield Drone**: increase the bearer’s Wounds by 1.",
